      content: 'Prefixes are added to the BEGINNING of words to change meaning. UN- = not/opposite (unhappy, unfair, unlock, undo). RE- = again (rewrite, rebuild, rethink, reopen). DIS- = not/opposite/away (disagree, disappear, disconnect, dislike). MIS- = wrongly/badly (misunderstand, misspell, mislead, misuse). Knowing prefixes lets you build and understand hundreds of words!',
